      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "PR for the webac ontology changes:",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo-webac-ontology/pull/1"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo-webac-ontology/pull/1",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "attrs": {
           "accessLevel": "",
           "id": "6089a48d248ef60073948d92",
           "text": "@Unknown"
          },
          "type": "mention"
         },
         {
          "text": ", looking at your implementation of rolesHavePermissions in WebACAuthorizationDelegate.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "It seems to rely on only one action for each permission, but with Update, Delete and Append these will overlap Write. Or at least they would in my mind. So I am looking at your logic ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo-module-auth-webac/blob/master/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/auth/webac/WebACAuthorizationDelegate.java#L113-L117"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "here",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Would it be adequate to reverse the flow and compare the roles provided to see if they give the actions requested (instead of the current opposite)?",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo-module-auth-webac/compare/master...whikloj:fcrepo-1794?expand=1"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "Here is a link",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": " to the comparison of my changes so far. The important one is how we manage the actionMap?",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
