     "body": "<p><a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=6089a4c12a753d0071341edb\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"6089a4c12a753d0071341edb\" data-account-id=\"6089a4c12a753d0071341edb\" accountid=\"6089a4c12a753d0071341edb\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Jared Whiklo</a> we discussed holding off on implementing these modes (acl:Update and acl:Delete) for now. They are not part of the w3c document.</p>",
