     "body": "<p>Based on the <a href=\"https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FF/Design+-+WebAccessControl+Authorization+Delegate#Design-WebAccessControlAuthorizationDelegate-Phase1\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">Phase 1 stakeholder use cases</a>, there is no need for these two modes to be added at this time</p>",
