  "description": "<p>Implement two new permissions for the WebAC framework. Both of these will currently be implemented on resources and not properties (at this time).</p>\n\n<p>See <a href=\"https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FF/Semantics+of+ACL+Modes\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FF/Semantics+of+ACL+Modes</a> for more information on the WebAC modes.</p>",
